            <ArticleTitle>Recent advances in the sleep apnoea/hypopnoea syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>108-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review highlights some of the advances in sleep apnoea/hypopnoea syndrome made over the last few years, particularly in diagnosis and treatment. Recent evidence of the controversial associations of sleep apnoea/hypopnoea syndrome with increased morbidity and mortality, particularly from cardiovascular disease, is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
